Test rg59: start names a label in the current bank, not bank 0
// go is defined in bank 0 and in bank 3, and the program ends in bank 3, so
// start go is bank 3's go.  The start address once dropped the bank and was
// 000200, bank 0's address; it is 030200.
100/
go, hlt
bank 3
200/
go, lac go:0
    hlt
start go
